 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Tensor-hom adjunction for pro-étale sheaves",
 "statement": "The derived hom of [def-sfb-derived-hom-sheaves] is right adjoint to the derived tensor\nproduct, as an adjunction with a parameter $-\\otimes^{\\mathrm L}-\\dashv\\RHom(-,-)$. In\nparticular, for every $K\\in D(X_{\\mathrm{proét}},\\mathcal A)$ there is an adjunction\n$K\\otimes^{\\mathrm L}-\\dashv\\RHom(K,-)$, and $\\RHom(K,-)$ is a right adjoint.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-proetale-coefficients/sk-def-sfb-derived-tensor-hom/def-sfb-derived-tensor-hom-adjunction-sheaves.md",
